{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, you've played Snake. But this is Snake like you've never seen before? <strong>Snake in the Dark</strong> is a total re-imagination of the timeless arcade and puzzle game classics like Snake and Sokoban. Fun gameplay you know delivered with more puzzling twists than you expect! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc0d<u>EAT AND SHINE!</u>\ud83d\udc01</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/eea3b2af062baf8c817fa7f95327f88a.poster.avif?t=1773231523\" width=780 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/eea3b2af062baf8c817fa7f95327f88a.webm?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/eea3b2af062baf8c817fa7f95327f88a.mp4?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is dark, and the snake can only see a few feet ahead. Consuming shiny white mice gives it a short glimpse of the whole level. Where are the walls? Where is the food? Where's your tail? Shine a light and find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf44<u>GROW BIG TO WIN!</u>\ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/8e9ba59fde34ef1bc0954f82b7d811fa.poster.avif?t=1773231523\" width=780 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/8e9ba59fde34ef1bc0954f82b7d811fa.webm?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/8e9ba59fde34ef1bc0954f82b7d811fa.mp4?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal in each level is to open the exit gate by simultaneously pressing all the pressure-plate switches and reach it while it's open. Snake too short? No problem! Eat more mice to get BIG and press all the switches at once. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udea8<u>PUSH STONES TO SOLVE PUZZLES!</u>\ud83e\udde9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/6fc53819d2adf3931fe4c01f4fa1fcda.poster.avif?t=1773231523\" width=780 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/6fc53819d2adf3931fe4c01f4fa1fcda.webm?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/6fc53819d2adf3931fe4c01f4fa1fcda.mp4?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look! A stone ball! Why not push it and use it to weigh that switch and open the doors? And what's this? A sinkhole in the floor is blocking your way? Fill it with another stone ball to make a bridge to slither over. Solve your problems Sokoban-style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Snake in the Dark is</strong></u><strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Over 100 puzzling levels combining Snake, Sokoban, and a bit of Boulder Dash! (16 levels in the demo alone!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 A fresh take on time-proven gameplay mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Glorious retro graphics and audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Uncompromising arcade challenge</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f</strong><strong><u>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW NOW!</u>\ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3198700?t=1773231523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/bac08ebad43608148a2da6891cba9a403a630b6e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773231523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/0c5d210ce885e3e395d1733865f7f15bd3268d20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773231523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/0c5d210ce885e3e395d1733865f7f15bd3268d20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773231523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3326020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, you've played Snake. But this is Snake like you've never seen before? <strong>Snake in the Dark</strong> is a total re-imagination of the timeless arcade and puzzle game classics like Snake and Sokoban. Fun gameplay you know delivered with more puzzling twists than you expect! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc0d<u>EAT AND SHINE!</u>\ud83d\udc01</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/eea3b2af062baf8c817fa7f95327f88a.poster.avif?t=1773231523\" width=780 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/eea3b2af062baf8c817fa7f95327f88a.webm?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/eea3b2af062baf8c817fa7f95327f88a.mp4?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon is dark, and the snake can only see a few feet ahead. Consuming shiny white mice gives it a short glimpse of the whole level. Where are the walls? Where is the food? Where's your tail? Shine a light and find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf44<u>GROW BIG TO WIN!</u>\ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/8e9ba59fde34ef1bc0954f82b7d811fa.poster.avif?t=1773231523\" width=780 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/8e9ba59fde34ef1bc0954f82b7d811fa.webm?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/8e9ba59fde34ef1bc0954f82b7d811fa.mp4?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal in each level is to open the exit gate by simultaneously pressing all the pressure-plate switches and reach it while it's open. Snake too short? No problem! Eat more mice to get BIG and press all the switches at once. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udea8<u>PUSH STONES TO SOLVE PUZZLES!</u>\ud83e\udde9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/6fc53819d2adf3931fe4c01f4fa1fcda.poster.avif?t=1773231523\" width=780 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/6fc53819d2adf3931fe4c01f4fa1fcda.webm?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/extras/6fc53819d2adf3931fe4c01f4fa1fcda.mp4?t=1773231523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look! A stone ball! Why not push it and use it to weigh that switch and open the doors? And what's this? A sinkhole in the floor is blocking your way? Fill it with another stone ball to make a bridge to slither over. Solve your problems Sokoban-style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Snake in the Dark is</strong></u><strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Over 100 puzzling levels combining Snake, Sokoban, and a bit of Boulder Dash! (16 levels in the demo alone!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 A fresh take on time-proven gameplay mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Glorious retro graphics and audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Uncompromising arcade challenge</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f</strong><strong><u>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW NOW!</u>\ud83c\udf1f</strong></h2>","developers":["Boruta.dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198700/3fcded8b395910b95121b94acd5bf451b01afbae/header.jpg?t=1773231523","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3198700/787834/b5532641853156d9741cde12ef9a40b4c16986df/1750880118/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732203680","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3198700/787834/b5532641853156d9741cde12ef9a40b4c16986df/1750880118/dash_h264.mpd?t=1732203680","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3198700/787834/b5532641853156d9741cde12ef9a40b4c16986df/1750880118/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1732203680","id":257074747,"name":"Snake in the Dark - announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257074747/3b57cdacc53f24b11e42f4b5f3d58b371d9bf591/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732203680"}],"name":"Snake in the Dark","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\